MoonWren
Copyright 2026 MoonWren contributors

MoonWren is an independent MoonBit implementation of the Wren language. The
public language documentation and compatibility behavior of Wren are used as
references; upstream source files are not included in this repository.

Wren is available at https://github.com/wren-lang/wren and is distributed
under the MIT License by Robert Nystrom and contributors.

The command-line package depends on moonbitlang/x, distributed under the
Apache License 2.0 by the MoonBit project contributors.
